            "level": {
              "value": 2
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "While your opponent is still recovering from your prior attack, you snag its armor, clothing, or flesh to move it as you please. Make a melee Strike with a finesse weapon or polearm. If you hit a target that is your size or smaller, you can automatically Reposition it, with the same benefits as the Reposition action (including the critical success effect, if your Strike was a critical hit). If you used a weapon with reach, use the weapon's reach for this Reposition.\n\nThis Strike has the following failure effect.\n\n- **Failure:** The target becomes off-guard until the end of your current turn."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
